{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんはじめまして\n乃木坂46 6期生　「森平麗心」です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一年前の今日、私のティザー映像が公開されました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobinDGh7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一年分の感謝はこのブログでは伝えきれないくらい多くて、、。\nまずは出会ってくださり本当にありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "公開された瞬間よく分からないけど号泣してて、、\n自分では気づいていなかったけど怖かったのかなと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は、自分にコンプレックスがたくさんあって、悩むことも多いです。\n誰かに支えてもらわないと崩れてしまう人間だから、皆さんが背中を押してくれることで一歩一歩前に進むことができました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな私の姿で誰かの勇気になれたらいいなって思っています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobWi8n33.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゼッケンが変わった時すごく嬉しかった☺️、、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob4vAlxc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobaXhBdA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どのぐらい変われたのかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobiokNAz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハッピーバレンタイン"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好き！\n2026.2.14"}], "source": "official"}